@@ -0,0 +1,305 @@
+# Korean (ko) catalog for ArtCraft Launcher.
+# Format: context<TAB>English source<TAB>translation (UTF-8).
+# Empty context = plain lookup; a named context disambiguates a label.
+# @id = command-id keyed (tr_id); @plural = one Korean form for all counts.
+# @msg = backend message template; placeholders keep their English names.
+#
+# Based on the Korean catalog by back2zion in storytold/craft-launcher#285 ("Add Korean
+# localization and system font support"), ported to v0.3.2: rows for features this version
+# doesn't have are left out, missing rows added, and some rows revised (docs/localization-ko.md
+# lists them). AI-assisted translation, not yet reviewed by a native speaker.
+#
+# Style: menus and buttons are short nouns (설치, 업데이트, 실행, 제거); messages are sentences in
+# 합니다체. Terms follow the Korean Adobe/Autodesk/Windows UI users know (릴리스 노트, 새로운 기능,
+# 모양, 이전 크기로, 파일 탐색기). Product and app names, placeholders, units, file formats and
+# technology names stay in English. Korean uses one plural form. Desktop rendering uses a system
+# Korean font (cjk_font.rs: Malgun Gothic on Windows); where none is available, and on the web,
+# the interface falls back to English.
+
+	Launcher	Launcher
+	Craft App Suite	Craft App Suite
+	Open Source Tools for Creatives, Makers, and Builders	창작자, 메이커, 개발자를 위한 오픈 소스 도구
+	Settings	설정
+	Check for updates	업데이트 확인
